#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"This option allows sound requests coming in from over the network to be "
"accepted, instead of just limiting the server to the local computer."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie laat toe klank versoeke komend in van bo die netwerk na wees "
"aanvaar, in plaas van van net te beperk die bediener na die plaaslike "
"rekenaar."

